Did you know you can press F9 to hide your hand? Hitting F9 again will bring it back.

You might want to use Pumpy to get things to be sizes that work well together.

Did you pick up the hours timer, press F9, and drop it on the left side of the pink
pad?

Did you drop a ":" next to the hours timer?

And then drop the minutes timer, ":", and the seconds timer on the pad?

If you make a mistake you can use Dusty to remove something to try again.

I would just drop the timers and the ":"s on the pink pad so they looked nice.
I'd hide my hand by pressing F9 so I can drop it more accurately. Maybe I would
use Pumpy to make the timers bigger before dropping them on the pad.


